# Backend origin for API and uploaded images.
#
# Local development:
#   Leave unset (or use http://localhost:5000). Vite proxies /api and /uploads
#   to the backend defined in vite.config.js.
#
# Render single-service deployment (API + client on one Web Service):
#   Leave UNSET. The built client calls /api on its own origin.
#
# Split deployment (Static Site + separate API Web Service):
#   VITE_API_URL=https://your-api.onrender.com
#   This is baked into the bundle at BUILD time, not at runtime.
#VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000
